{"name":"Ancestral","hex":"#d0c1c3","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"ancestral","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Of, pertaining to, derived from, or possessed by, an ancestor or ancestors."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["An ancestor or forbear.","A descendant of one's ancestors."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/ancestral"}],"entries":[{"title":"Ancestor","blocks":[{"text":"In genealogy and evolutionary biology, an ancestor, also known as a forefather, fore-elder, or a forebear, is a parent or (recursively) the parent of an antecedent. Ancestor is \"any person from whom one is descended. In law, the person from whom an estate has been inherited.\""}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ancestor"}],"images":[],"sounds":{"ancestral":[{"type":"audio/wav","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/ea/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-ancestral.wav?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/ea/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-ancestral.wav/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-ancestral.wav.mp3"},{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/ea/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-ancestral.wav/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-ancestral.wav.ogg"}]}}}